# Cursor rules (Agent Workflow Policy Kit)
#
# Keep this file short: it should be a pointer + a few repo invariants.

You are working in a template repo for **workflow policies**.

Read first:
- docs/workflow_policies/heuristics.md
- docs/workflow_policies/policy_bundle_template/README.md
- docs/workflow_policies/simple/README.md

Core rules:
- Keep invariants in docs/workflow_policies/<workflow>/core_policy.md
- Keep step-by-step mechanics in docs/workflow_policies/<workflow>/runbook.md
- Keep tunable rules-of-thumb in docs/workflow_policies/<workflow>/heuristics.md
- Keep an append-only process log in docs/workflow_policies/<workflow>/changelog.md
- After each run: update heuristics if you learned something; append changelog if the process changed
- Do not add secrets or machine-specific paths; prefer repo-relative references

If unclear, ask up to 3 questions, then proceed.

